window.products.push({"id":542011,"name":"Stainless Steel Wing Corkscrew Wine Opener, Waiters Corkscrew Cork and Beer Cap Bottles Opener Remover, Used in Kitchen Restaurant Chateau and Bars","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yeTQDCj9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our premium wing corkscrew wine bottle opener makes for the perfect gift, housewarming gift, bachelorette party gift, Christmas gift or \"Thank-you\" gift. The fun and unique look of our wine bottle opener will have her thinking of the fun & unique friend who gave it to her every time she sees it! owning a professional wine bottle opener, you can be able to efficiently remove the cork from the wine bottle without too much time and effort, and then freely taste fantastic wine. Applications : -Perfect gift for the wine enthusiast. -A great way to break the ice when meeting new friends. -Can be used to open bottles of wine and bottles of beer. Easy operation: 1.firstly drill into the cork, than put down two wings. Classic winged corkscrew design makes removing corks simple and easy. With metal gears, the corkscrew easily removes wine cork in seconds. 2 .functions: beer cap opener and red wine bottle corkscrews. Double levers with tight tension for good leverage. Metal construction to ensure comfortable, confident use. Package Content: 1. Material: Stainless steel 1. Wine Bottle Opener Product warranty: Our products have been rigorously tested, stable quality and security, if your product has any problems, we unconditionally give you a free replacement or a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yeTQDCj9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LESTAVEN","source_asin":"B07S9LQSS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S9LQSS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S9LQSS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
