window.products.push({"id":542041,"name":"Bigso Jakob Canvas Paper Laminate Storage Box with 12 Dividers, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zYi87V1aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bigso Jakob storage box is stylish and durable. It's divided into 12 separate holders designed to hold items such as ties, watches and many other things. It comes with a secure lid and leather handles. It's covered in quality canvas. It measures 12.2 by 17 by 4.1 Inch. Bigso's paper laminate products have a core of thick, recycled fiberboard. The look is contemporary and elegant. Bigso was founded in 1963 and at that time all our products were produced in recycled fiberboard. The emphasis in the beginning was on products that were tucked away in closets and attics. Fiberboard was seen as an economical solution for a range of storage needs for homes and businesses and our entire production went to the Swedish market. Bigso's products have become a major decorating feature in the homes and offices of over 30 countries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zYi87V1aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bigso","source_asin":"B00FTWKGN0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FTWKGN0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FTWKGN0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
