window.products.push({"id":542145,"name":"GLANT Rustic Wall Mounted Jewelry Organizer with Wooden Barndoor Decor,Wooden Wall Mount Holder,Jewelry holder for Necklaces, Earings, Bracelets, Ring","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h67tDmccL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Are your necklaces always tangled? Can you never find the matching earring?  Get rid of the mess and get your jewelry and life organized!  GLANT Wall Mounted Jewelry Organizer is what you are looking for. It will keep all of your earrings paired neatly in each compartment and beautifully displayed.  About GLANT GLANT is a newborn, energetic and creative brand.GLANT has won a large number of loyal customers with simple but chic design, excellent price but high quality products, responsible and timely customer service. GLANT focuses on the products of home and life and stands firmly behind its design. We hope that GLANT can accompany everywhere and add more conveniences in your daily life.  About GLANT Wall Mounted Jewelry Organizer:  We redefine and design this Wood Jewelry Organizer, adding a rustic barn door, effectively organizing your jewelry and preventing dust.  The GLANT Wall Mounted Jewelry Organizer is the ultimate hanging jewelry organizer. It arrives ready to store hundreds of jewelry pieces, keeping them tangle-free and ready for easy access! Made of high quality wood with a rustic finish. Never lose a matching earring pair again!  Removable Bracelet Rod: The removable bracelet rod makes it extremely easy to store bracelets, bangles, watches, bands, and cuffs. Just lift and slide for easy access. Keep all of your accessories in one spot.  Hooks for Necklaces:Tangle free necklaces! 33 hooks line the bottom of our organizer, so it's easy to keep all of your necklaces organized and accessible. You will never have to pull the annoying knots out of your chains again!  Earring Mesh: The back wire mesh allows you to hang and organize earrings. Gone are the days of mismatched or lost earring pairs. Quickly find the perfect set that matches your outfit.  Slots of Rings:The ring slots can effectively and neatly store more than 10 rings The top display shelf can hold additional accessories","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h67tDmccL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLANT","source_asin":"B07RSQGF2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RSQGF2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RSQGF2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
