window.products.push({"id":542223,"name":"Portable Air Conditioners, Mini Evaporative Air Cooler with 7 Colors, 3 Strong Speeds, 2 Spray Humidity Personal Desktop Spray Fan,1/2/4/8H Timer, Sma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71za9vDj2dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【Efficient Cooling Air Conditioner Cooler】Our mini air conditioner featured with 2 atomization humidification holes and Powerful DC motor, featuring an industry-leading honeycomb waterfall system, which is able to reduce the surrounding temperature up to 45-50℉ and instantly provide you a powerful,cool, refreshing airflow. Moreover, you can also add cold water or ice cubes on top for better cold breeze ❄️【3 Wind Speeds & 3 Humidifier Modes】This evaporative air conditioner features with 3 speed modes (Low/Medium/High) and 120°Up and Down adjustable wind direction design. Even more, the portable fan has 3 mist modes (Low/Medium/High), The humidifier function increase air humidity, allowing you to cool better, moisturize the skin and rehydrate.so that you can choose the ideal wind direction and modes to meet your needs.( Note:No adapter included. Suitable for 5V 1.5A above USB adapter.) ❄️【Multi-Functional & 7 Colors LED Lights】Four-in-one design, it is not only a cute small personal air cooler, but also a table fan, humidifier, led night lights. this ac fan has built-in 7 soft colors night light, you can touch LIGHT button to choose your favorite night light. In addition, this mist fan operates at low noise (less than 50dB), and will not disturb your life, working and sleep. Featured with USB charging port, which can be powered with power bank, laptop,adapters, computers, vehicle chargers. ❄️【1-8H Timer & USB Supply Air Cooler Fan 】With a large sealed water tank, the air conditioner portable for room can works up to 8 hours (on low cood mist mode) when it filled up. The swamp cooler is programmable for up to 8 hours, which allows you to enjoy working, reading or a deep sleeping without the headaches and colds caused by prolonged cool winds. (Note:the Water Shortage Protection Function will automatically stop blowing cool mist while the water level is too low) ❄️【Gift Option & Widely Application】This small portable air conditioner fan is suitable for bedroom, living room,study room, kitchen, offices, outdoor picnics, cabins, outdoor tents. we always aims to provide the best products, valued prices, and excellent service to our customers. We shared our product with many volunteers and everyone was satisfied. If you have any questions about our products or services, please feel free to reach us by clicking the \"Contact Sellers\" button. We will do our best to assist you with your inquiry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71za9vDj2dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"let'me","source_asin":"B0C6X8X5DX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6X8X5DX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6X8X5DX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
