window.products.push({"id":542333,"name":"Auber Instruments Thermometer for Stove Pipe,Chimney,Outdoor Wood Boiler (Washer Sensor for Single Wall (TC-K-WS))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J1phbX6vL.jpg","description":"This bundled package can be used for stove pipe, chimney and outdoor wood boiler temperature monitoring. This thermometer reads a thermocouple probe, shows the temperature on its red LED display, and makes a buzzing sound when temperature rises above the pre-set alarm temperature. For stove pipes and chimneys, probes can be attached to the chimneys or the surface of stoves. For wood boilers, the probe can be attached to the hot water line to monitor the temperature of the water. There is a built-in buzzer in the thermometer. The thermometer contains two alarm settings. One alarm can be set as high limit alarm and other can be set as low temperature alarm (low fuel alarm). The gauge is powered by 12V DC through an AC adapter (included) for continuous operation. It can also be powered by a 12V car battery. The cable length for power adapter is 3 ft.   Three types of sensor options are available. One is a washer sensor for single wall pipe. It is to be mounted on the surface of the pipe or stove with a #10 screw. The other is a 4\" (100 mm) probe that can be used for double wall pipe. User need to drill a 1/8\" hole to insert the probe. . The longer sensor cable allows the user to place the meter in one room and probe in the other room (or floor). The magnet probe can be attacehd to magnetic surfaces and walls. It can measure up to 750 ºF (400 ºC). Magnet may lose some of the holding force above that. The cable lengths for these three sensors are 6 ft (2m).   Display unit: °C or °F.  Accuracy: +/-5 ºF over the entire range.  Temperature range (with K type TC) : -320 ºF-1650 ºF. (higher temperature probe is available upon request)  Washer Sensor for Single Wall: Max. working temp.: 900°C (1650°F). Cable insulation: Fiberglass with stainless steel overbraid (900 °F).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J1phbX6vL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Auber Instruments","source_asin":"B0189MPAZA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0189MPAZA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0189MPAZA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
