window.products.push({"id":542574,"name":"Sandicast Blue Merle Australian Shepherd with Holiday Lights Resin Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wU-ah996L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When the holiday season Arrives, don't forget that pets love the festivities just as much as we do! Sandicast charming collection of Christmas ornaments features over 40 different breeds of man's best friend enjoying the holiday spirit in a variety of ways: some sport bright red Santa hats or are cozily wrapped in winter scarves, others are decked out in strings of lights or carrying Christmas stockings. Several breeds are also available in multiple expressions and poses (sitting, standing, lying, sitting pretty or crouching), each one \"decorated\" for holidays in a different way. Sandicast Christmas ornaments have a securely attached metallic cord loop for hanging and are packaged in a protective reusable box that's perfect for year-round storage. But don't feel compelled to put that special ornament away just because the holidays are over . We won't tell! Sandicast was founded in 1981 when artist Sandra Brue realized her dream of combining her artistic talent and her lifelong love of animals. Because of the superb quality of her work, collectors around the world now pursue the demand for Sandicast animal sculptures. Queen Elizabeth and president Clinton are just a few of the many celebrities that have Sandicast animals. Sandra has sculpted more than 400 animals; the Sandicast collection includes everything from dogs and cats to exotic wildlife. Each piece is hand-cast and hand-painted and virtually comes to life when sparkling glass eyes are inserted. Sandicast invites you to discover their extensive collection of hand sculpted animals available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wU-ah996L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandicast","source_asin":"B01GCL0WC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GCL0WC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GCL0WC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
