window.products.push({"id":542629,"name":"Genuine Fred Purr Over Cat-Style Porcelain Pour Over Coffee Brewer, One Size, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613boCyuZTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use Genuine Fred purr over brewing set for a purrrfect cup of Coffee every time. Place a standard #2 cone filter in the top section, add ground Coffee, then simply pour boiling water over the grounds. Fresh-brewed Coffee flows through the cone and directly into the mug below. Made of sturdy porcelain. Dishwasher and microwave safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613boCyuZTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Genuine Fred","source_asin":"B07B81TFTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B81TFTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B81TFTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":542630,"name":"5 x RENNET & CHEESE SALT MIX 6g POUCH For any type of cheese 1 pouch for 50 litres of milk …","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fJG+V72mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rennet GRANULES AND CHEESE SALT MIX 5 X 50L from BEST4KITS has a high enzyme activity, having power to coagulate safely any kind of cheese you choose to manufacture, from cow, sheep or goat. Safety during coagulation is one of the basic wishes of the producer of cheese, and for this reason, the curd should be carefully selected and maintained in the condition necessary to not lose enzymatic activity. Technology manufacturing, curd.It has a validity of three years , during which, when stored at ambient temperatures, its enzymes remain active.Maintaining the quality of rennet for extended time is achieved both by way of manufacturing the tablet, and their special packaging that protects good tablet exposure to air, moisture, heat, light or other environmental factors. Great for any type of cheese. How to make cheese using rennet mix 1.Add 20-30 ml of clean water (no chlorine) a dash of lemon or vinegar. If the water contains chlorine and add a little milk. Crushed tablet of rennet and dissolved in a solution ready. Mix until completely dissolved. Add liquid into the milk heated to about 35 ° C. Mix the milk slowly and steadily for three minutes. Allow the mixture to stand for 25-40 minutes, or until it coagulates. Cut the curd, then follow the steps for manufacturing cheese type desired.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fJG+V72mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Ideal Company","source_asin":"B073RRCS72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073RRCS72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073RRCS72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
