window.products.push({"id":542699,"name":"Yosemite Home Decor Prism II, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9103A0gexjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DCA021B is an abstract painting which can evoke very powerful feeling. Such a composition is compelling both to the heart and the mind. It can fit in almost any context. A complex geometric system painted in earthy neutral colors mixed with icy Blue touches, this painting is bound to impress and baffle the viewer. DCA021A is built from various brushstrokes which are of different colors. They are sewn together with dark straight lines into a geometric pattern. The darker shapes balance the painting. The coppery and pea green splashes give it a warmer feeling which powerfully contrasts with the cooler, almost frozen tones of Blue. The geometrical shapes slowly fade into creamy light beige tones. The shapes and colors seem to be falling towards the center-right area of the painting, where the geometry becomes more crowded, more compact. It is a powerful piece which can easily induce a meditative state with relaxing effects on the owner. This work of art is hand painted on a gallery wrapped canvas and signed by the artist ensuring each piece has some subtle differences making it distinctly unique to each owner. The high quality canvas wraps tightly around a sturdy wooden frame that will last for years to come. The painting comes with either a pre-strewn wire or hinges on the back so that its ready for immediate wall mounting. The light weight of the piece allows for easy hanging without worry of damaging your wall. The acrylic paint creates a rich texture that will really catch the light, creating a very sophisticated allure. Each painting is carefully packaged and inspected prior to shipping, ensuring every piece arrives safely and ready to hang on your wall, making for a pleasant purchasing experience from beginning to end.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9103A0gexjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yosemite Home Decor","source_asin":"B00ESLQR4A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ESLQR4A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ESLQR4A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
