window.products.push({"id":542802,"name":"50 Disposable Easter Egg Shaped Place Mats Kids Eggs Hunt Coloring Activity Paper Table Mat 11.25”x 14.8” Spring Color Your Own Sheets for Holiday Din","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zbR42U3UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pack of 50 die cut disposable Easter egg shaped place mats. This Easter oval paper place mat is double sided and features pastel colored designed egg with flowers and dots, and color your own black and white design on other side. Accent your fine china or dinnerware with a touch of tropical country-inspired style with the paper egg place mat. Perfect for seafood restaurants, tropical resorts, graduation, bridal and baby shower, retirement, or birthday party, wedding receptions, banquets, rehearsal dinners, dining hall, kitchen, hotel and business office. Are your kids always finishing Easter dinner before you want them to get up from the table? Or are they antsy waiting for dinner to get ready? The happy Easter activity coloring place mats helps entertain kids while they sit quietly at the table. These place mats are perfect for classroom parties and crafts! They also make a great art activity for Easter home school planned by teachers. They are a great alternative to coloring tablecloths and coloring books. Easter egg hunt games place mats are professionally printed on sturdy paper. Each Sheet measures 11.25” x 14.8” the perfect size for your children to have fun and play with this holiday season!! Their big size doesn't just help create a large arts and crafts area...it also helps keep your table clean from the kid's messes. This Easter place mat greatly enhances your table decor! Parents can dispose of the used place mats after meals, hang them on walls as art, or they can save them as a special scrapbook keepsake to help remember and celebrate childhood memories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zbR42U3UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Boutique","source_asin":"B0B2FF3K6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2FF3K6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2FF3K6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
