window.products.push({"id":542811,"name":"Chefman Air Fryer with Space Saving Flat Basket Oil Free Airfryer w/Dishwasher Safe Parts, 30 Minute Timer & Auto Shut Off, 3.5 Liter, Black (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51z+Q+dLwyL._AC_SL1049_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51z+Q+dLwyL._AC_SL1049_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07QRZZKDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QRZZKDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QRZZKDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":542812,"name":"Totally Bamboo 18-Inch Lazy Susan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oerS92i9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep everything organized, accessible and looking ever so good with Totally Bamboo's Lazy Susan. It's perfect for tabletop use, but can also be used in cabinets and pantries. Lazy Susan is 18-inch in diameter. It's made of strong bamboo. From the original bamboo cutting board company, Totally Bamboo, this lazy susan is a beautiful and functional addition to any kitchen. Bamboo is the natural alternative for all things wood. It is the fastest growing plant on our planet and does not require any special care to grow. In fact, it is a grass that produces more oxygen than a hard wood forest of comparable size, it helps to reduce carbon dioxide gases blamed for global warming, and it helps to prevent soil erosion through its widespread root system and large canopy. At Totally Bamboo, we are proud to say we use only the highest quality bamboo, harvested at the optimum age of 5 years from our own bamboo forests. There are over 1200 species of bamboo; however, we choose to use “Moso” timber bamboo for its strength, density and versatility. As an added bonus, it is not a habitat for pandas. Our factories adhere to a very stringent protocol for curing and processing the bamboo, ensuring the highest quality product. We take steps to ensure that our employees are well taken care of and work in a safe and hazard free environment. Our goal is continuous improvement through design, developing new, unique and innovative products which appeal to the environmentally conscious.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oerS92i9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B002RL9CTA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002RL9CTA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002RL9CTA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":542813,"name":"Leeva Green Tie Up Valances Curtains for Bathroom, Watercolor Floral Thermal Insulated Adjustable Balloon Rod Pocket Windows Shade for Dining Room, On","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913d5wuYl1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STANDARD SIZE: Sold 1 piece in per package, tie up window treatment shade measuring 42\" Width by 63\" Length(Height), top rod pocket. NATURAL FABRIC: Made of 15% Linen 85% Polyester. About 60% blackout. Let nature light in and still protect privacy. FUNCTION: Lend a touch of casual luxury and cute style to your window treatments with this elegant thermal insulated kids curtain valances. CRAFTED WITH CARE: Constructed with about 1\" header and 1.7\" rod pocket and 1\" bottom hem, slips effortlessly across your curtain rod for quick, tool-free installation. Special attention is given to stitching ensuring there are no loose threads and uneven hems/edges. EASY CARE: This vivid window panel drape is easy for cleaning, machine washable to allow for quick and effortless home care, use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low and warm iron as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913d5wuYl1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leeva","source_asin":"B0BDGGB76B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDGGB76B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDGGB76B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":542814,"name":"Handcrafted Moscow Mule 100% Solid Pure Copper Unlined Mug/Cup (16-Ounce/Set of 4, Hammered, Premium Brass Handle)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JL8mJheIL._AC_SL1455_.jpg","description":"Moscow Mule Ingredients for 16 oz Mug 1/2 Ounce Lime Juice/Lime Slice  2 Ounces Vodka (or more if you've had a rough day)  6 Ounces Ginger Beer  Fresh Ice and Solid Copper Mule Mug Squeeze lime juice into a Solid Copper Moscow Mule mug and drop in the spent shell. Add ice cubes, then pour in the vodka and fill with cold ginger beer. Serve with a stirring rod. Don't be afraid to mix up different flavors of vodka. Peach and cucumber vodka are very popular also! Enjoy! Why Solid Copper? Solid Copper is important for chemical ionization of acids commonly found in citrus fruits like lemon, orange, grapefruit, and of course, lime. This is why other fancy copper mugs with nickel, tin, or other metal and food lacquer linings do not have the same taste as solid copper mug. The acid ionization of solid copper mugs for moscow mules is the premise of purchasing the mug in the first place. We are focused on providing high quality mugs that stay true to the history of the Moscow Mule drink. With that in mind, if you're looking to create original recipes and are getting stuck, try starting with your 'acid base' instead of your liquor base. Care Instructions Uncoated copper will tarnish naturally. Many of our customers prefer the antique or vintage tarnished barware look. To remove tarnish, apply an inexpensive acid such as white vinegar and table salt. To minimize tarnish, hand wash in minimal chemicals. These copper mugs are of the highest quality, which is why we offer a LIFETIME no-hassle guarantee from manufacturer defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JL8mJheIL._AC_SL1455_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazing 22","source_asin":"B00V4BUFXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00V4BUFXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00V4BUFXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
