window.products.push({"id":542816,"name":"Miosal RGB Led Strip Lights 16.4ft 5m Dimmable 5050 LEDs Waterproof LED Rope Lighting Color Changing with Remote Control for Decoration Home, Bedroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U3ksSvS1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【High quality RGB LED Strip】 High quality 5050 SMD LEDs for 16 single-colors and 4 color-changing modes. The brightness and color-changing speed can be increased and decreased by remote control. It is a great product for home and holiday decoration 【Super strong adhesive tape】Easy to stick on dry and clean surface. Also includes 15 sets clips and screws to install more firmly or strengthen in the corners 【Cuttable and joinable】 Can be cut by scissor into desired length along the cutting marks on the LED strip; and can be re-connected by the included cable connectors, which is commonly used for turning corners more smoothly 【Wide Application】 This led strip is ETL listed for safety and quality assurance. Low heat, touchable, safe for children. Suitable for DIY decoration in living room, bedroom, dining room, kitchen, cabinet, car, desk, etc. Also perfect for holiday parties, like Christmas, Halloween, wedding and more 【Quality】 As a reliable manufacturer, we conduct strictly quality control to maintain all of goods delivered to you are at good conditions. The most often reported issue about this LED strip is that it cannot be turn on, which is mainly caused by incorrect installation. Cautions: 1. The Triangle mark on the connector of control box MUST point to “ +12V” on the LED strip; 2. The insulation plate in the remote unit MUST be removed before you can use it to control the LED strip .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U3ksSvS1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miosal","source_asin":"B08C262MPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C262MPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C262MPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":542817,"name":"Gonesh Everyday Ocean Incense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Vc8ed+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GONESH EVERYDAY Because life doesn't wait for special occasions. Here's to everyday! To the little things that matter, and matter most. Your personal routine. Your daily rituals. Your ongoing obsessions and quirky habits. You don't need a special occasion to make everyday special, it already is! A light, gentle fragrance outburst from the makers of Gonesh Extra Rich Incense. An incense that truly mixes well with every day. Whether it's bust or robust. Life goes on. Stick with it. About our Incense: Gonesh continually strives to elevate the level of fragrance delivery by working with creative and skilled perfumers, by using the highest quality raw materials, and by our exclusive use of High Charcoal. Unlike wood powder, charcoal produces no smoke- allowing the fragrant oil to vaporize and the scent to come through without smoke. Gonesh Incense has the highest charcoal content of any brand currently on the market - it delivers the purest, cleanest burn, and crystal clear fragrances. About our Company: We're out to change the image of incense in America. By operating in the bustling city of Chicago, we can that our incense is high quality, ethically sourced and environmentally responsible. Today Genieco's Gonesh brand includes a variety of \"green\" and practices, including a recent installation of Solar Panels on our warehouse rooftop. We take great pride in supporting green energy and do our part in reducing our carbon footprint. DIRECTIONS: Hold a lighted match to the coated end of a stick until it glows; blow out flame. Place sticks in an incense holder, a flowerpot, or a glass filled with salt, sand or earth. Be sure that the ashes fall on a fireproof surface. WARNING: Keep burning stick away from flammable articles such as papers, drapes, etc. Do not allow sticks to touch any varnished, painted, plastic, etc. surfaces. Never leave burning incense unattended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Vc8ed+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gonesh","source_asin":"B07J59HGJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J59HGJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J59HGJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":542818,"name":"LockerWorks 2 Shelf Hanging Locker Organizer, Sturdy & Compact, 23-25\" Tall x 6\" Wide x 9\" Deep, Shelves 12\"-14\" Tall, Hangs from Shelf, Hooks or Rod ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CxwmJdctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GET ORGANIZED Neat freak, pig pen, or somewhere in between, everyone can get organized with LockerWorks. It is an essential school supply for students with lockers. INSTANT STORAGE SPACE LockerWorks creates functional storage space in school lockers to help students stay organized every day. Educators know that the majority of academic problems stem from poor organization rather than lack of academic talent, and the U.S. Department of Education says the #1 way to assist children with their homework is to help them get organized. ADJUSTABLE FOR DIFFERENT CONFIGURATIONS LockerWorks hangs inside the locker from a shelf, a side and top center hook, two side hooks, or a rod. It fits lockers of any width, but at just 6” wide, it fits even narrow lockers. For standard width (12”) or wider lockers, LockerWorks leaves room for coats, backpacks, sports gear, etc. The length can be shortened from 38” to 20” by snapping up the bottom shelf or adjusting the position of the hangers. LockerWorks can hang from hooks on different levels because of multiple hanger positions on each side. The quality construction, heavy duty fabric, steel hangers, and rigid shelf inserts are designed for years of use. An open back design provides maximum flexibility for storage items of varying depths. IT'S NOT JUST FOR LOCKERS Because it hangs from a closet rod or shelf as well as hooks, at only 6” wide LockerWorks creates extra storage space anywhere you can hang it: closets, mud room, garage, office, RV, dorm – wherever it’s needed. There is a hump on the bracket to fit over closet rods, and it slides onto shelves up to 1.5” thick. Rubber tips keep the brackets in place. DIMENSIONS 6” W x 9” D. Length adjustable from 23–25.\" Bottom shelf 12” tall; top shelf 14” QUALITY GUARANTEED We are committed to 100% customer satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CxwmJdctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LockerWorks","source_asin":"B013MIGPSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013MIGPSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013MIGPSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
