window.products.push({"id":542823,"name":"Candoury Satin Body Pillow Cover, 20x54 inches Silk Satin Body Pillow Pillowcase for Adults, Soft Silky Body Pillow Case with Envelope Closure (20x54,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ednFUQqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Quality】 Made from the finest quality satin polyester, these pillowcases will meet all your needs for a classy pillowcase and a durable one. You will feel silky and fall in love with its softness as you lay your head on it. 【Guaranteed Beautiful Hair】 The silky smooth fabric is perfect for you, and sleeping on a Candoury pillowcase will help keep your hair moisturized and healthy, avoiding tangles, frizz and breakage. It won't absorb moisture, leaving hair with a healthy shine. The beauty of the day starts with waking up! 【Cosmetic Effect】 Are you worried about the wrinkles on your face? Are you concerned that they may be getting worse? It could be your pillowcase causing you all that. Candoury satin pillowcases will help you ensure that your face remains wrinkles even in old age. The pillowcase comes with an innovative cosmetic effect that allows your skin to remain smooth. 【Envelope Sealing】 We know how frustrating it can be when the pillowcase zipper catches on to your hair or gets stuck as you try to take out the pillow. We help you overcome this through our careful envelope design. Of course, it can also lock the pillow firmly, so there is no need to worry about the pillow escaping when falling into a dream. 【Easy to Wash】 These pillowcases are easy to keep clean and conveniently so as well. You can quickly wash these pillowcases by hand wash or if you prefer a machine-wash, that will work fine as well. The 100% satin polyester remains in good condition after each wash. Additionally, these pillowcases dry quickly when you hand them out to dry in the sun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ednFUQqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Candoury","source_asin":"B08F142649","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F142649","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F142649","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
