window.products.push({"id":542882,"name":"CYS EXCEL Glass Apothecary Jar. H-14.75\", Body-6.5\" Decorative Classic Candy Buffet Jar, Elegant Glass Storage Container.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7117QDYMrcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimension: Height: 14.75\", Opening: 3.5\", Body Width: 6.5\", Base: 5\" Quality - As a 20-year leading professional direct importer of glassware and vase fillers, CYS Excel has served hundreds of major department stores, décor wholesalers, retailers, florists, designers, and wedding & event planners. CYS Excel makes sure that the master crafter uses premium glass to handblown each product to perfection. Uses - Apothecary jar was a given name to those used in a professional medical facility. Throughout history, Crafters have created many different appearances for these jars, resulting in a unique style of a glass storage unit. These jars' unique designs have become an astonishing choice of glass decor for events, buffets, and home displays. Looks- With the idea to categorize different materials being put into these jars. Shapes were one of the leading design ideas. However, these designs became more stylish, and people use them more for modern decorative looks. It is no doubt that the Apothecary jars are one of the most valuable antiques for glass decor. Occasions - These are great for buffet and event parties. They provide a lid to keep dust or insects to come in contact with the food. Most importantly, they are a sight for sore eyes! The unique designs on these jars pretty much attract the attention to those who come across it—a modern style centerpiece for glass storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7117QDYMrcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CYS EXCEL","source_asin":"B004YDAUXQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004YDAUXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004YDAUXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":542883,"name":"MAMA WUNDERBAR 12 Pack White Sage ~ Sage Smudge Sticks for Smudging & Cleansing Energy ~ Bulk/Wholesale ~ Sustainably Grown (12 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C1WBxTZZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smudging is an ancient ceremony that originates from the Native America culture. The act of Smudging—or burning particular herbs for the medicinal and therapeutic properties of their smoke, is an ancient method that clears a specific space of negativity and allows it to manifests as positive energy. Even if you don’t believe that the smoke and ritual rid you of negative energy there is no denying a better state of mind through the practice. The aromatherapy and ritualistic steps of smudging promote a more mindful, purified and centered state of being. When to Smudge? Even the happiest of people accumulate negative vibrations over time so some find it helpful to smudge themselves, other people, their homes or objects several times a year. Smudging is part of a sacred ceremony so the best way to perform it is in a mindful and slow manner. Here are some examples of when smudging is helpful. When moving into a new home, flat or room. When you want to cleanse the energy from a particular place or object. When feeling depressed, anxious, or otherwise unusual. When needing to focus energy or thoughts. Before sleep to prevent nightmares and sleep better. When needing to relax.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C1WBxTZZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAMA WUNDERBAR","source_asin":"B08KYLWK8N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KYLWK8N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KYLWK8N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
