window.products.push({"id":542964,"name":"16.5\" Iron Black Finish Dutch Oven Lid Lifter with Spiral Bail Handle for Lifting and Carrying Dutch Oven Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51namvJTBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【16.5 inch Length】: Dutch oven lid lifter length is about 16.5in. The tool is long enough to keep you a safe distance from the pot and the fire. ✅【Cast Iron Construction】: Dutch oven lid lifter is made of durable cast iron construction with black finish, sturdy, durable and long service life. ✅【Spiral Handle】: With spiral handle for comfort and lower temperature. With the lid lifter, you can safely lift hot lids and move dutch ovens from the fire. ✅【Widely Uses】: Dutch oven lid lifter is great for lifting and rotating lids. Perfect for kitchen, backyard, outdoor camping, picnicing, hiking and more. ✅【Good Workmanship】: Exquisite workmanship, beautiful appearance, portable size, providing you great using experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51namvJTBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AGOEIN","source_asin":"B0B7WCR1H9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7WCR1H9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7WCR1H9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":542965,"name":"Zouron Mid-Century Modern Dining Chairs, Leather Accent Kitchen Chairs with Rattan Back, Armless Upholstered Fabric Spone Chairs with Chrome Metal Leg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lmWInilmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【MODERN DESIGN STYLE】 - Zouron' chairs form versatile and simple to suit a variety of interior decor styles - kitchen, bedroom, living room, more better, Mid-Century modern style fits very well into contemporary interiors. The eternal desire is sticking to clean-cut and architectural lines as signature. ✅【FRAME STRUCTURE】- It is feature by a chrome-plated curved steel frame design, which is simple and elegant in shape and provides a stable support structure, the whole frame has implemented a cleaner and more rational geometric aesthetics. Each steel tube used in this rattan back dining chair is thicker than ordinary tubes, so the stability is unquestionable. ✅【HAND-WOVEN RATTAN & OAK WOOD BACK & SPONGE SEAT】- The backrest is composed of hand-woven rattan and oak frame, which allows the backrest to be breathable while also elastic, provide comfortable support for the back, having the advantages of permeability and comfort, maintaining a cool and dry sitting feeling. The cushion is made of PU leather upholstery and filled with high-density sponge. It feels smooth and soft, provide day-long comfort. ✅【MULTIPURPOSE】- A stunning alternative to traditional dining chairs, is one of the best furniture to transform style of interior, bring style to every occasion. Their form simple and versatile to suit a variety of interior decor styles ---kitchen, bedroom, living room, patio. even better, the mid back can streamline the aesthetic of the entire dining room since the chairs are unlikely to stick up above the height of the table. ✅【ASSEMBLY EASY & DIMENSION】- Easy to assemble. Product Size: 19.69\"W X 23.82\"D X 34.06\"H ; Seat Height: 20.08\" ; Seat Size: 19.69\"W * 16.34\"D; Weight Capacity：265 lbs. If you have any problems or questions, please feel free to contact us! Reply within 24 hours！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lmWInilmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zouron","source_asin":"B0B8N1883P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-542965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8N1883P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8N1883P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
